# API Routes

API routes are located in [src/app/api](mdc:src/app/api) using Next.js App Router:

- [src/app/api/auth](mdc:src/app/api/auth) - Authentication endpoints
- [src/app/api/exercises](mdc:src/app/api/exercises) - Exercise management
- [src/app/api/workouts](mdc:src/app/api/workouts) - Workout management
- [src/app/api/user](mdc:src/app/api/user) - User data
- [src/app/api/strava](mdc:src/app/api/strava) - Strava integration

API route files use the Next.js Route Handlers pattern with:
- `route.ts` files for GET, POST, PUT, DELETE methods
- Request/response follows REST API conventions
